          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<ul><li>“I can’t seem to commit the Tarot card meanings to memory.”<br/><br/></li><li>“I try, but memorizing 78 cards is SO hard.”<br/><br/></li><li>“There are so many different Tarot card meanings – I never know which is the right one.”<br/><br/></li><li>“I think I know the meanings of the cards, but sometimes my mind goes blank!”<br/><br/></li><li>“I still need to look up the card meanings in a book. How will I ever be able to read for other people if I always need to check what a book says?!”<br/></li></ul><p><strong>If Any Of These Statements Resonate With You, Then Read On. I’ve Got Really Good News For You!</strong></p>"
          }
        },
