    "testimonials": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonials-0": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>“I enjoyed the relaxed manner that Brigit presents her classes with. You feel as if you are sitting having coffee with her and discussing something she loves – a lot different than the pressure of “being in class.”</p>",
            "author": "KIM VAN DYKE",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "eb8e6586-7771-45c1-868d-aef4fbc266eb": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>“I have taken a few classes from local teachers, but never retained enough about the meanings to confidently do a reading and after taking Master the Tarot Card Meanings, I now have a system that I can use to determine what each card means.”</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/keith_campbell.jpg",
            "author": "KEITH CAMPBELL",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "426eeede-fdfd-4b82-8eda-ba2d62d68ac6": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>“Master the Tarot Card Meanings is a course that provides you with the resources and skills to learn Tarot with enthusiasm and wonder for the rest of your life. It was so much more than I ever anticipated or thought possible – and so much fun!” </p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Donna-Brody.jpg",
            "author": "DONNA",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "e12e6b0b-43b4-4723-987f-e7322d904069": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>“Prior to starting the course, I had self-doubt on many levels. Now, I feel entirely enlightened on the magical process of how the cards speak! I am able to start seeing new messages other than key words and my confidence is starting to build when I make a suggestion in a reading and the client is amazed at the accuracy. It's such a beautiful and brilliant process!”</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/laurel_santiago_tf1.jpg",
            "author": "LAUREL SANTIAGO",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonials-1": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>When I started the Food Matters Nutrition Certification Program, I was doing so to heal my own chronic illness. I was blown away with the amount of information that was provided and have discovered so many ways to improve my health. I love the printed workbook and find studying from reading very helpful. One thing that has surprised me the most is where my studies have taken me! I have used the knowledge I have gained to create Chronic Illness Healing Workbooks, for mental and physical health. I hope to help and inspire others struggling with their health to make changes and see improvements. I’m so grateful I decided to take the course and highly recommend it to everyone!</p>",
            "author": "Sarah",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonials-2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>I loved every minute of the training, and am grateful for the support of the Food Matters tribe: the awesome, responsive staff, and the savvy, passionate students. The experience was like a fire hose of information, so I'm really happy that all of the course materials are available for me to go back and review again and again. All of the Resources at the end of each module are also really helpful. I'm eager now to jump into the Bonuses and learn how to parlay my newfound knowledge into a business so I can help others live their healthiest, most vibrant lives possible. Thank you!!!</p>",
            "author": "Kasia",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        }
      },
